 "Уголок — фигурка из трёх клеток буквой Г": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,30px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">уголок — это квадрат 2×2, у которого <span style=\"color:var(--muted)\">одна клетка вырезана</span>; какая именно — это и есть его поворот</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">в задаче повороты считаются <b>разными</b> положениями</div><figcaption>Фигурка задаётся двумя вещами сразу: где стоит её квадрат 2×2 и какой угол у него пуст.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Заметь главное. Диагональ уже дала каждой строке": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">заполнена только диагональ</div><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,40px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">3/4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px dashed #2c394c;color:var(--muted)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">4</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start\"><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">кандидаты клетки (1, 2)</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:0px\"><span style=\"color:var(--red)\">не 1</span> — единица уже стоит в этой строке</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:0px\"><span style=\"color:var(--red)\">не 2</span> — двойка уже стоит в этом столбце</div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">остаются <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">3 и 4</span> — ровно две ветки</div></div></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">дальше выбора нет: как только в строке появилось второе число, два оставшихся расходятся по двум клеткам вынужденно — одно из них диагональ уже поставила в свой столбец</div><figcaption>Диагональ бьёт каждую пустую клетку сразу с двух сторон, поэтому кандидатов у неё не больше двух — и весь квадрат висит на одной-единственной развилке.</figcaption></figure>",
 "расставляют в три столбика по три клетки": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,34px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">1</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">3</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">2</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">5</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">4</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\">9</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#12281c;border:1px solid #2b5c3d;color:var(--green)\">8</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">7</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">15</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">15</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--sans)\">15</span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">одно из двенадцати заполнений: суммы столбиков равны, внутри каждого — по возрастанию</div><figcaption>Порядок внутри столбика навязан условием, поэтому выбирается только разбиение на тройки и то, какая тройка в каком столбике.</figcaption></figure>",
 "В доску из 4 строк и 10 столбцов": "<figure class=\"st\"><div style=\"display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,34px);gap:3px;font:15px var(--mono)\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">7</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">6</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#3a2f18;border:1px solid #6b5320;color:var(--gold)\">8</span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#151d29;border:1px solid #2c394c;color:var(--ink)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#16263a;border:1px solid #3d5a82;color:var(--blue)\"></span></div><div class=\"flab\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">период 3 в обе стороны: <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">4-я строка</span> повторяет 1-ю, 4-й столбец повторяет 1-й, 5-й — 2-й</div><figcaption>Вся доска — это квадрат 3×3, размноженный вправо и вниз; три вписанных числа садятся на его клетки по остаткам.</figcaption></figure>",
